Sanitization
Sanitization : process increasing the uncertainty in the data in order to preserve privacy.
⇒ Inherent trade-off between the desired level of privacy and the utility of the sanitized data. Typical application : public release of data (offline or online context).
Examples drawn from the “sanitization” entry on Wikipedia
