Possible origin of the bias
1. Problem in the data collection due to some error or the fact that the data is inherently biased.
I Examples : mistake in the profile of the user, dataset reflects discriminatory decision against a particular population.
2. Inaccuracy due to the learning algorithm.
I Example : the algorithm is very accurate, except for 1% of the individuals.
